'''Machoke''' (Japanese: '''ゴーリキー''' ''Goriky'') is a {{ct|Fighting}} Stage 1 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Shining Revelry}} expansion.

